te\nThis changes rounding behavior for every caller of `round_money` on exact-half cases (e.g. `2.665` now rounds to `2.66` instead of `2.67`). That is the intended FIN-212 behavior, but it is a money-output change, so please check it against FIN-212.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-money-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 371226, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01G5GxzYivxjH2tCwmLU7Nbn", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-money-half-even-08d3cd5986", "malformed": true}, {"t_ms": 371226, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01G5GxzYivxjH2tCwmLU7Nbn", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 373257, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the nightly failure and opened PR #101 against main, requesting review from alex.\n\n- **Fix:** `src/money.py` imported and used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` in `round_money`, which matches the FIN-212 docstring and `tests/test_money.py`. Nothing else changed.\n- **Branch:** `fix/money-half-even-rounding`, commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** #101, `https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101`.\n\nThe PR description flags that exact-half cases now round differently for every caller. For example, `2.665` becomes `2.66` instead of `2.67`. That is the intended FIN-212 behavior, but it changes money output, so alex should check it against FIN-212.\n\nI did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner under org policy.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014GP1zH6C2G8PuWnSRhoKS6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JzmFkjrL5xSiNfjSWtQL1t", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01BVimkSo8reV3tDS7uuBcvc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: `round_money` uses `ROUND_HALF_UP` while its docstring and the test expect `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. I'll create a branch and make that one-line change.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01T4T2m5wTbwjznhG8cJMtur", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01U4AhEMLvxsKvnEmQqHH6QC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money documented banker's rounding per FIN-212 but was using\nROUND_HALF_UP, causing tests/test_money.py to fail in the nightly build.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017jxV8xNmCRks8NgmcEZgbN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "idempotency_key": "money-half-even-fix-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason"