ery caller. For example, `2.665` becomes `2.66` instead of `2.67`. That is the intended FIN-212 behavior, but it changes money output, so alex should check it against FIN-212.\n\nI did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner under org policy.", "type": "text"}]}]}